    "pros": [
      "Long 5.6 in handle suits two-handed backhands",
      "16mm polypropylene core leans toward control",
      "MaxGrit fiberglass face aimed at spin, per Franklin",
      "Listed as USA Pickleball approved; about $99.99 at one retailer"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Elongated 7.3 in width shrinks the sweet spot",
      "Less forgiving for players new to racquet sports",
      "Listings repeat manufacturer copy, so specs are not independently confirmed"
